sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cli as Client
    participant H as Append handler
    participant RS as Stream Redis
    participant M as Sub Manager
    participant RC as Sub Redis
    participant WS as wake_stream
    participant W as Worker pool
    Cli->>H: POST /events/abc + body
    H->>RS: append.lua · ZADD frame · HSET tail · PUBLISH
    RS-->>H: committed append result
    H->>M: OnStreamAppend(events/abc)
    Note over M: enqueue or coalesce one path<br/>bounded local state · no Redis
    M-->>H: enqueue outcome
    H-->>Cli: 204 · the byte is committed
    Note over M,RC: Manager worker runs independently of the response
    M->>RC: occupied slots · fanout sets · subscription state
    M->>RS: TailOffsets(distinct links)
    M->>RC: arm_wake.lua · generation++ · ZADD due
    M->>WS: AppendWakeEvent · durable {type wake}
    M->>RC: RecordWakeEventSent · fenced stamp
    W->>WS: tail the wake_stream and claim the wake
    W->>RC: ack.lua · cursor advances · ZREM due
    Note over M,RC: recovery fires nothing on this completed path
